#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:2
msgid "Milk-V Duo board (``milkv-duo``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``milkv-duo`` machine is compatible with the Milk-V Duo development "
"board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:6
msgid ""
"The Milk-V Duo is an ultra-compact embedded development platform based on "
"the Sophgo CV1800B SoC. The CV1800B features T-Head C906 RISC-V processing "
"cores along with integrated peripherals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:10
msgid "For more information, see <https://milkv.io/duo>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:13
msgid "Supported devices"
msgstr "支援的裝置"

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:14
msgid "The ``milkv-duo`` machine supports the following devices:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:16
msgid "T-Head C906 cores"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:17
msgid "Core Local Interruptor (CLINT)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:18
msgid "Platform-Level Interrupt Controller (PLIC)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:19
msgid "DesignWare APB UART (dw8250)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:20
msgid "SDHCI controller"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:21
msgid "CV1800B clock controller"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:24
msgid "Boot options"
msgstr "開機選項"

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:25
msgid ""
"The ``milkv-duo`` machine supports direct boot using a generic RISC-V "
"OpenSBI firmware and a Linux kernel. The root filesystem can be provided via "
"the emulated SD card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:30
msgid "Running"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:31
msgid ""
"To boot the machine, you need a Linux kernel (built with CV1800B support), a "
"device tree blob (DTB), and a root filesystem image (e.g., built via BusyBox "
"or Buildroot)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:35
msgid ""
"Use the following command to boot the system directly to the Linux shell:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:37
msgid ""
"$ qemu-system-riscv64 -M milkv-duo -nographic \\\n"
"   -bios pc-bios/opensbi-riscv64-generic-fw_dynamic.bin \\\n"
"   -dtb /path/to/linux/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/cv1800b-milkv-duo.dtb \\\n"
"   -kernel /path/to/linux/arch/riscv/boot/Image \\\n"
"   -drive file=/path/to/rootfs.ext4,format=raw,id=sd-card \\\n"
"   -device sd-card,drive=sd-card \\\n"
"   -append \"console=ttyS0,115200 root=/dev/mmcblk0 rootwait earlycon\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/riscv/milkv-duo.rst:47
msgid ""
"This command boots the generic OpenSBI firmware, loads the Linux Image and "
"the specified DTB, and mounts the ext4 root filesystem from the emulated SD "
"card. The console output is routed to the ``ttyS0`` serial port."
msgstr ""
